  "title": "REPAY Completes Acquisition of KUBRA",
  "summary": "REPAY Becomes a Leading Consumer Bill Payment Provider Announces Investor Day for December 2026 ATLANTA--(BUSINESS WIRE)--June 1, 2026-- Repay Holdings Corporation (NASDAQ: RPAY) (“REPAY” or the “Company”), a leading provider of integrated payment processing solutions, today announced that it has completed the acquisition of Kubra Data Transfer LTD. (“KUBRA”). Under the terms of the agreement, REPAY acquired KUBRA for $372 million in […]",
